  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The MRV project&lt;/b&gt; (National Measurement, Reporting and Verification system for mitigation, adaptation and climate finance) aims to improve climate resilience in Mozambique. Its objective is to support the Government (central, provincial, and local) of Mozambique in implementing climate change strategies and actions for the benefit of all, women and men in all their diversity.</narrative>
